        "id": "local-edit",
        "label": "本地查看与修改",
        "focus": ["user", "local", "workspace", "preview", "hub"],
        "note": "本地渲染端示例为 Claude Desktop，预览由 worktree 与静态服务器承载；角色不绑定具体操作系统。"
      },
      {
        "id": "remote-sync",
        "label": "远端同步预览",
        "focus": ["user", "remote", "hub", "preview"],
        "note": "远端托管端示例为 Claude Code CLI；它拉取 feature 分支并重启预览，不直接编辑本地源码。"
      },
      {
        "id": "merge-after-review",
        "label": "确认后合并",
        "focus": ["user", "local", "remote", "hub"],
